# These scripts run on Curiosity v2 (Linux) via `bash script.sh`. Force LF
# regardless of core.autocrlf on a Windows checkout — a CRLF line ending
# breaks the shell on Linux (e.g. `set -e\r` parses as an illegal option),
# which is exactly what happened when start_docker_stack.sh got checked out
# with CRLF on 2026-09-14 and failed on dgx08 with "Illegal option -".
*.sh text eol=lf
